{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19226","headline":"裴相公大学士见示答张秘书谢马诗幷羣公属和因命追作 · 刘禹锡","name":"裴相公大学士见示答张秘书谢马诗幷羣公属和因命追作","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"草玄门户少尘埃，丞相幷州寄马来。\n初自寒垣衔苜蓿，忽行幽径破莓苔。\n寻花缓辔威迟去，带酒垂鞭躞蹀回。\n不与王侯与词客，知轻富贵重清才。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘禹锡","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_19226.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19226","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}